{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frog Bard is a short, poetic experience about finding inspiration in the world around you. Explore a simple forest and perform reflective ballads as you travel from inn to inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive through a procedurally generated forest to find sparks of inspiration. Select thoughtful themes for your songs to perform at an inn. Break even and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Please note that Frog Bard is a short (5-10 minutes) but re-playable experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features an original song played on a guitar that was now\u00a0modified so\u00a0we'll\u00a0never\u00a0hear\u00a0that guitar\u00a0play\u00a0this song\u00a0again!!!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490420?t=1744406389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490420/f53d5b963d52c41897c22c70f77bafc8a36822d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744406389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490420/ecc812f9f2c282b1297ae43245aed564f23bbe29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744406389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490420/ecc812f9f2c282b1297ae43245aed564f23bbe29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744406389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frog Bard is a short, poetic experience about finding inspiration in the world around you. Explore a simple forest and perform reflective ballads as you travel from inn to inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive through a procedurally generated forest to find sparks of inspiration. Select thoughtful themes for your songs to perform at an inn. Break even and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Please note tha